  "details": "I have noticed this issue because of the thinking emoji I added to the character under Armature. In full body tracking, when I moved my body while having any tabs in vrchat opened, the Armature stopped moving with the body. This caused some very unnatural twisting in the upper body while turning around. I also tested this without the FBT and the armature was moving with the body as it should be.\n\nhere is a video that I took\n0:00 ~ 1:28 with FBT\n1:28 ~ 2:47 Without FBT\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F_SsbxJDvd8&feature=youtu.be\n",
